OL,3,GNEWSA'He secretly took intimate photos
OL,4,Athen used them to control me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma was 17 when she met a 26-year-old
OL,7,Fman, posing as a 17-year-old boy, on a
OL,8,Fdating site. On a video call, she says
OL,9,Fhe pressured her to take off her
OL,10,Fclothes. He then secretly took
OL,11,Fscreenshots of her naked.
OL,13,FAccording to Emma, he obtained more
OL,14,Fduring the relationship and threatened
OL,15,Fto share them if she did not do what he
OL,16,Fwanted.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
