OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1787244946
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'He secretly took intimate photos
OL,4,Athen used them to control me'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If I were to end the relationship, he
OL,7,Fwould expose them. If I were to not do
OL,8,Fwhat he said, he would expose them,"
OL,9,Fshe says. "He held this threat over my
OL,10,Fhead to the point that I only became a
OL,11,Fshell, and did what I was told because
OL,12,FI was in fear of the repercussions."
OL,14,FSextortion, or sexual extortion, is
OL,15,Foften associated with demands for
OL,16,Fmoney, but Emma's case shows intimate
OL,17,Fimages can also be used as a means of
OL,18,Fcontrol.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
